== CLAUDE.md [grimoire] (claude-code) block grimoire
@AGENTS.md
== GEMINI.md [grimoire] (gemini-cli) block grimoire
@AGENTS.md
!! warning[adapter/agent-readonly]: cursor runs `security-reviewer` with `readonly: true`, which blocks edits and state-changing shell commands; shell commands Cursor judges harmless stay available, and whether it limits MCP tools and web fetches is undocumented
!! warning[adapter/agent-strict-tools]: copilot limits `security-reviewer` to its tools with `strict-tools-list: true`, which VS Code doesn't pass on, so in VS Code the agent may also get Copilot's default tools
!! warning[adapter/agent-strict-tools]: copilot limits `silent-reviewer` to its tools with `strict-tools-list: true`, which VS Code doesn't pass on, so in VS Code the agent may also get Copilot's default tools
!! warning[plan/cross-client-agent]: `security-reviewer`: VS Code loads the .claude/agents/ copy as well as the .github/agents/ one, and which it uses is undocumented (Copilot CLI uses .github/agents/)
!! warning[plan/cross-client-agent]: `silent-reviewer`: Cursor also loads it from .claude/agents/, has no per-tool allow-list, and how it treats a Claude Code agent's `tools` is undocumented, so it may get all of the parent agent's tools; VS Code loads the .claude/agents/ copy as well as the .github/agents/ one, and which it uses is undocumented (Copilot CLI uses .github/agents/)
!! warning[plan/cross-client-hooks]: Cursor and GitHub Copilot also run hooks from .claude/settings.json, so `secret-guard`'s hooks run there too; whether they pass `args` and honour `onFailure` is undocumented, so there a hook may let actions through when it fails, or block every tool call if its arguments are dropped (turn off Claude Code hooks in that client to recover)
!! warning[plan/duplicate-rule]: Cursor may read `commit-style` twice: it reads AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md, and whether it expands the `@AGENTS.md` import in CLAUDE.md is undocumented
!! warning[plan/duplicate-rule]: Cursor may read `rust-errors` twice: it reads AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md, and whether it expands the `@AGENTS.md` import in CLAUDE.md is undocumented
!! warning[plan/duplicate-rule]: GitHub Copilot CLI may read `commit-style` twice: from AGENTS.md and through the `@AGENTS.md` import in CLAUDE.md (it deduplicates only identical copies)
!! warning[plan/duplicate-rule]: GitHub Copilot CLI may read `rust-errors` twice: from AGENTS.md and through the `@AGENTS.md` import in CLAUDE.md (it deduplicates only identical copies)
!! warning[plan/duplicate-skill]: Cursor reads skills from both .claude/skills/ and .agents/skills/, so it lists `adr-writer` twice
